# The oracle harness and the workflows ask for their owner's review (spec 3.5, 3.6).
#
# oracles/ holds the comparison logic, the drivers, the recorded answers and their
# hashes, the known divergences, the gate's policy and the corpus. .github/ decides
# which checks CI runs and with which restrictions: a weaker invocation would turn CI
# green without touching the harness. A pull request runs its own edited workflow,
# and GitHub applies the base branch's CODEOWNERS, so both are owned here.
#
# This binds only once branch protection on `main` requires a review from a code
# owner. Until then it only requests one.
/oracles/ @Silicon-Spider
/.github/ @Silicon-Spider
